flowchart TD
  S[symbol + snapshot + signed position] --> M[ModelSignalGenerator.generate]
  M --> P[Persist model decision]
  P --> U{UNCHANGED or no quote?}
  U -- yes --> STOP[No order]
  U -- no --> R[RiskManager.assess]
  R --> A{approved side + qty?}
  A -- no --> STOP
  A -- yes --> C[clear conflicting open orders]
  C --> O[submit OrderRequest]
